# Smart Inventory Management - Implementation Plan

## Phase 1: Project Scaffolding & Setup
1. Create Laravel project in `c:\laragon\www\APLIKASI INVENTORY BERBASIS PROJECT`
2. Install core dependencies: Spatie Permission, Laravel Excel, etc.
3. Configure `.env` for MySQL, Mail, Queue, Google Calendar
4. Setup TailwindCSS via Vite

## Phase 2: Database & Migrations
Tables: users, roles, permissions, inventories, categories, projects, borrow_transactions, return_transactions, risk_scores, risk_rules, ai_suggestions, notifications, audit_logs, system_settings, login_histories

## Phase 3: Models & Relationships
All Eloquent models with proper relationships, soft deletes, and scopes.

## Phase 4: Service Layer
- InventoryService
- BorrowService
- ReturnService
- RiskScoreService
- AISuggestionService
- ReminderService
- GoogleCalendarService
- AuditLogService

## Phase 5: Controllers & Form Requests
Clean MVC with Service injection

## Phase 6: Blade Views + TailwindCSS
Modern SaaS UI, fully responsive, dark mode optional

## Phase 7: Multi-Language (id, en, zh)
Laravel localization - all texts via translation files

## Phase 8: Queue & Scheduler
Email reminders, overdue checks via cron

## Phase 9: Admin Panel
Dynamic role/permission, risk rules, AI rules, system settings

## Phase 10: Testing & Polish
